                <li><strong>Recipient Comes Online:</strong> Server detects connection → pushes all queued messages instantly</li>
                <li><strong>Status: Delivered (✓✓):</strong> Recipient receives message, confirms to server</li>
                <li><strong>Status: Read (✓✓🔵):</strong> Recipient reads → notification sent back to sender</li>
